OL,3,GNEWSASix swans a swimming after town
OL,4,Acentre rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family of swans spotted sitting in a
OL,7,Ftown centre resident's garden "as if
OL,8,Fthey were waiting for their taxi" have
OL,9,Fbeen safely transported to a nearby
OL,10,Flake.
OL,12,FThe two adults and four cygnets were
OL,13,Ffirst seen swanning around near a
OL,14,Fbowling green on Occupation Road,
OL,15,FCorby, Northamptonshire, on Saturday.
OL,17,FWhen charity volunteers arrived from
OL,18,FCambridgeshire the next day, they found
OL,19,Fthe birds sunning themselves on
OL,20,FHazelwood Road.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
