OL,3,GNEWSASix swans a swimming after town
OL,4,Acentre rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being safely rounded up into big
OL,7,Fblue Ikea bags, they took a back-seat
OL,8,Ftrip to a lake about a mile away.
